# scripts/check-deferral-markers.allowlist
#
# Every tracked deferral marker in the tree, one per line, as `path:MARKER`.
# `scripts/check-deferral-markers.sh` fails on any marker not listed here, AND
# on any line here whose marker is no longer in the tree — so this file is a
# cap on outstanding deferrals, not a suppression list.
#
# To add a line you need an issue. To delete one, do the work.

